.PP
The copyright for the project and its name are still held by Shie Erlich and Rafi Yanai\&.
.SH "I18N"
.PP
Krusader is translated into many languages\&.
.PP
\m[blue]\fBhttps://l10n\&.kde\&.org/stats/gui/trunk\-kf5/po/krusader\&.po/\fR\m[]
.PP
Read the
\m[blue]\fBKDE translation howto\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[3]\d\s+2
if you want translate Krusader in your native language\&.
.SH "FAQ"
.PP
The latest version of the KRUSADER FAQ can be found on
\m[blue]\fBKDE documentation site\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[4]\d\s+2\&.
